     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I just tested the \"DELETE ... WHERE {}\" and \"DELETE DATA\" queries and was able to successfully delete the triples. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "My commands: ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "language": "java"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "# create resource\r\n  curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\" -X PUT;\r\n# insert triples\r\n curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\" -X PATCH -H \"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\" --data \"INSERT DATA { <http://localhost:8080/rest/test1> <http://example/> <http://localhost:8080/rest/test101>. }\r\n\r\n# I verified it was there in the OCFL.  Then verified it was there in the response:\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\" \r\n# Then I confirmed that is was deleted via\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin \"http://localhost:8080/rest/test1\" -X PATCH -H \"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\" --data \"DELETE { <http://localhost:8080/rest/test1> <http://example/> <http://localhost:8080/rest/test101>. } WHERE {}\"\r\n# repeated the above but tried deleting using the DELETE DATA syntax.\r\n \"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\" --data \"DELETE DATA { <http://localhost:8080/rest/test1> <http://example/> <http://localhost:8080/rest/test101>. }\"",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "There ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "type": "em"
           }
          ],
          "text": "is a related issue",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " with external ids not being properly translated to internal ids,  which is captured in this ticket: ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3311"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3311",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
