     "content": [
      {
       "text": "If you attempt to use a PATCH request with a statement using DELETE DATA it returns the 204 No Content response but did not actually change anything. This happens with both normal users and admin users.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The below example works because there is an ACL allowing testuser read/write access at ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
