      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I just tested the \"DELETE ... WHERE {}\" and \"DELETE DATA\" queries and was able to successfully delete the triples. </p>\n\n<p>My commands: </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\n# create resource\r\n  curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1\"</span> -X PUT;\r\n</span># insert triples\r\n curl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1\"</span> -X PATCH -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\"</span> --data \"INSERT DATA { &lt;http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1&gt; &lt;http://example/&gt; &lt;http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test101&gt;. }\r\n</span>\r\n# I verified it was there in the OCFL.  Then verified it was there in the response:\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1\"</span> \r\n</span># Then I confirmed that is was deleted via\r\ncurl -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1\"</span> -X PATCH -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\"</span> --data <span class=\"code-quote\">\"DELETE { &lt;http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1&gt; &lt;http://example/&gt; &lt;http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test101&gt;. } WHERE {}\"</span>\r\n</span># repeated the above but tried deleting using the DELETE DATA syntax.\r\n <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Content-Type: application/sparql-update\"</span> --data <span class=\"code-quote\">\"DELETE DATA { &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test1&gt; &lt;http://example/&gt; &lt;http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/test101&gt;. }\"</span></span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p> </p>\n\n<p>There <em>is a related issue</em> with external ids not being properly translated to internal ids,  which is captured in this ticket: </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3311\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3311</a></p>\n\n<p> </p>",
     "created": "23/Jun/20 5:15 PM",
